ks","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" allow you to achieve the look of hardwood or tile at a fraction of the cost. They are all ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"entry-hyperlink","data":{"target":{"sys":{"id":"3Q2ufsOJw3vMiRoLc69F5v","type":"Link","linkType":"Entry"}}},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"waterproof","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", easy to clean and maintain, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"entry-hyperlink","data":{"target":{"sys":{"id":"YwIjHtiqnM8PF1SKPdEeF","type":"Link","linkType":"Entry"}}},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"scratch resistant","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" and more. Learn more about the most popular types of vinyl plank floors:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Expanded Polymer Core (WPC):","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Manufactured with a rigid expanded PVC core instead of a solid PVC backing, WPCs have tiny air pockets in the core that create great sound properties in a space. This expanded core is joined with a traditional thin LVT Cap to create it’s visual and usually has an attached pad on the back to create softness under foot. Most WPC products have a locking system and are installed as a floating floor requiring no glue.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Solid Polymer Core (SPC):","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" This type of flooring includes a solid PVC core with a thin traditional LVT cap to create the visual. This solid un-plasticized core is incredibly stiff and tough with great indentation and temperature stability properties. This product is also generally a floating floor and can be installed without any glue.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Traditional Luxury Vinyl Tile (LVT):","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Traditional LVT floor is composed of multiple layers of flexible PVC making it much less stiff then the rigid core products. It is composed of a scratch resistant wearlayer, a decorative/image layer and a durable flexible backing layer and is known to be stable and reliable. Most Traditional LVT requires adhesive and is glued to the floor in an installation.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-entry-block","data":{"target":{"sys":{"id":"1kcQ5uPOyjlsULgaVTOuqo","type":"Link","linkType":"Entry"}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Available at Mannington","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Mannington has a family of four vinyl plank options called ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"entry-hyperlink","data":{"target":{"sys":{"id":"7HMpeZYz99h9X7TDkHQEaw","type":"Link","linkType":"Entry"}}},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ADURA®","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":". Any ADURA® vinyl plank floor you choose offers the same incredible detail, stunning style and high-performance features. Simply choose the ADURA® floor that best matches your lifestyle – learn more below:  ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"entry-hyperlink","data":{"target":{"sys":{"id":"4LNVWOEMm2jNmL12BWGQQH","type":"Link","linkType":"Entry"}}},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ADURA®APEX","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"– this WPC floor is perfect for making a statement in any room including kitchens, bathrooms, foyers, living areas, dining spaces. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}},{